        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Ground: cream white linen, woven at one end in a chevron pattern, at the other in \"goose-eye.\" Design: across the middle three ornamental bands woven with blue cotton; center band, stars in lozenges, on one side birds and castles on the other birds and rosettes. Woven lace sewed across each end."@en ;
